    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62493" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέπτο-θριξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐχος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with fine hair</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔθειρα</span>, of the eagle, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				5.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτότριχες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					966b33
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτότριχοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					518b6
				</span></i>
			: neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτότριχα</span> (which
			may come from either form), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				783a2
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			 -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχώτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					538b8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
